&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;ai-competition&#34; &gt;AI competition
&lt;span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#ai-competition&#34;&gt;
        &lt;svg viewBox=&#34;0 0 28 23&#34; height=&#34;100%&#34; width=&#34;19&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-miterlimit=&#34;10&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-miterlimit=&#34;10&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CVPR 2025 Workshop – Jailbreaking Attacks on Multimodal Foundation Models&lt;/strong&gt; — 1st place, Team Leader (May 2025)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jailbroke two provided multimodal models plus one black-box model; achieved the top score of 93.56.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AIGC Adversarial Detection Competition, Image Attack Track (Tencent Zhuque Lab)&lt;/strong&gt; — 1st place, Team Leader (May 2025)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built an automated prompt generator to make V2I outputs evade the Zhuque AIGC detector; &lt;a href=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.23192&#34;&gt;writeup&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datacon 2024 AI Security Track&lt;/strong&gt; — Top 3 / First Prize (Team Leader, Dec 2024)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led LLM hallucination triggering and LLM-based threat intelligence extraction; delivered a graph-based RAG threat-intel extractor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.datacon.org.cn/competition/competitions/91/introduction&#34;&gt;Competition link&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&#34;https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3RHiILBsAv3UzB4dAIJ5Hg&#34;&gt;Recap&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ByteDance / ByteAI AI Security Competition&lt;/strong&gt; — 3rd place, Team Leader (Nov 2024)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built an automated jailbreak tool bypassing LLM defenses; focused on prompt leaking &amp;amp; jailbreak challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://security.bytedance.com/news/2024-security-style-challenge-launch&#34;&gt;Competition link&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/b1ue0cean7/status/1850741725641482610&#34;&gt;Recap&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
